---

## The observatory roof

::bg{location="roof" time="dusk"}
::music{action="start" mood="romantic" volume="down"}
::auto{character="ren" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@ren{code="0010" emotion="stern"}: This roof is off limits. I have the only key. Therefore I am the only one who can break the rule, and I am choosing to. Sit.
@ren{code="0020" emotion="flustered"}: I come up here to name the stars. Officially they have names. I give them better ones.

::date{with="ren" spot="roof" resultKey="stars"}

<match on="scene.date.stars.mood">
  <when is="perfect">
    @ren{code="0030" emotion="happy"}: That one is yours now. I just decided. Don't argue with the president.
    ::use{component="cg" id="cgRenStars" instance="use-001"}
    ::set{run.aff.ren += 2}
  </when>
  <when is="sweet">
    @ren{code="0040" emotion="fond"}: You're a terrible astronomer. Come back tomorrow and be terrible again.
    ::set{run.aff.ren += 1}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @ren{code="0050" emotion="sad"}: ...It's cold. We should go down. I'll sign you out.
  </otherwise>
</match>
@narrator{code="0010" when="scene.date.stars.hearts >= 5"}: He walks you to the dormitory door and forgets, for once, to check the time.
